    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hi, I'm an HR Operations Manager at a global software company. I need to draft a memo to our remote employees regarding workplace ergonomics. Could you help me outline some key points I should include about maintaining a proper workstation setup to prevent repetitive strain injuries (RSI)? I want it to sound professional and supportive.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For your memo, start by emphasizing the company's commitment to employee well-being and preventing RSI. Include practical advice on setting up chairs and desks, recommending that monitors be at eye level and arms be at a comfortable 90-degree angle when typing. Finally, encourage employees to take frequent short breaks throughout the day to stretch and move, framing this as a proactive health measure.",
